From bc527149b3b97c5519c4db3a11f23797cb55afb5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UMP <ump@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/90] jvm: short default network timeouts for mods' online
 checks

Mods' update/Patreon checks (Xaero's maps) opened URLConnections with no timeout and waited ~10 s for the system connect timeout during the world's start when a host didn't answer. sun.net.client.defaultConnectTimeout=3000 and defaultReadTimeout=5000 let them fail fast; mods setting their own keep theirs. UMP load test, 100 mods: warm start 73 s -> 52 s, world join 30 s -> 22 s.
---
 crates/horizon-jvm/src/lib.rs | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/crates/horizon-jvm/src/lib.rs b/crates/horizon-jvm/src/lib.rs
index 129275c2b9..0e7ec2e73b 100644
--- a/crates/horizon-jvm/src/lib.rs
+++ b/crates/horizon-jvm/src/lib.rs
@@ -616,6 +616,12 @@ fn create_vm(
         "-XX:G1PeriodicGCInterval=30000".into(),
         // Mods' identifiers and the mirror's names repeat: ~1.3M strings in a big pack.
         "-XX:+UseStringDeduplication".into(),
+        // Mods' online checks (update checkers, Patreon lists: Xaero's maps) opened with
+        // URLConnection's default of no timeout waited ~10 s each for the system's connect timeout
+        // on the world's start when a host didn't answer (UMP load-time test, 100 mods). A short
+        // connect timeout lets them fail fast; mods that set their own keep theirs.
+        "-Dsun.net.client.defaultConnectTimeout=3000".into(),
+        "-Dsun.net.client.defaultReadTimeout=5000".into(),
     ];
     if let Some(archive) = archive {
         options.push("-XX:+AutoCreateSharedArchive".into());
